<title>USA: Koo Koo Roo sets buyback of 1.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Koo Koo Roo sets buyback of 1.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koo Koo Roo Inc, a restaurant chain, said Thursday its board had authorized a program to repurchase up to one million shares.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made from time to time in the open market, it said.</p>
<p>Koo Koo Roo is not obligated to buy any particular number of shares and the plan may be suspended at any time at the company's discretion, it said.</p>
</text>
